:INFO
Art. 19 Deadlines for drawing up and implementing plans
1 The cantons shall ensure that:
a. the plans under Article 5 paragraph 1 are drawn up within five years of this Act coming into force;
b. the plans are implemented within twenty years of this Act coming into force.
2 The Federal Department of the Environment, Transport, Energy and Communications may extend the deadlines by way of exception for individual areas. The Federal Council shall regulate the requirements for extending the deadlines.
|

:INFO
Art. 20 Amendment of other legislation
The Amendment of other legislation is regulated in the Annex.
|

:INFO
Art. 21 Referendum and commencement
1 This Act is subject to an optional referendum.
2 The Federal Council shall determine the commencement date.
Commencement date: 1 January 2023
|

